('Hans Ulrich Obrist', 'curators', 'partnership_core', 'United Kingdom', 'https://www.serpentinegalleries.org/whats-on/serpentine-podcast/hans-ulrich-obrist', 'Rhiannon Stanford', 'Assistant / Studio Manager', 'to_contact', 'Lead obtained 2026-08-02: closest assistant is Rhiannon Stanford. Obrist is the strategic convener for the GARF–IFAR–Lovable four-way collaboration. Pitch: European AI center for art documentation, authentication, and provenance research. Initial approach should be short, personal, and mission-led.'),
('Lovable', 'other', 'partnership_core', 'Sweden', 'https://lovable.dev', NULL, NULL, 'to_contact', 'Potential technology partner for the GARF–IFAR–Obrist alliance. Lovable''s AI-native app platform could power the public registry, authentication tools, and dealer/auction-house APIs. Approach: propose a strategic partnership where Lovable becomes the technology execution partner to a mission-driven foundation, with commercial revenue flowing through a separate operating company.');